EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}You're finally here! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I thought maybe
you two decided to go off {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}and have
a little party without me!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Da seid ihr ja endlich!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich dachte schon, ihr beiden hättet
euch aus dem Staub gemacht und
ohne mich gefeiert!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I borrowed an item of yours a while
ago, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}and I totally forgot I had it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I thought it was about time I tried
to return it to you. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Don't worry—{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
it's still in mint condition!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Bir süre önce senden bir şey ödünç
almıştım, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}sonra bende olduğunu tamamen unutmuşum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Artık geri vermeyi denesem iyi olur diye
düşündüm. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Merak etme—{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
hâlâ sıfır gibi duruyor!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¿Te acuerdas de eso que me
regalaron para mi cumple y que
tanto te gustó?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Pues te he comprado uno,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Solo quedaba en este color.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Si te gusta, es todo tuyo.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Doğum günümde aldığım o havalı şeyi
ne kadar diline doladığını hatırlıyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Resmen kıskançlıktan çatlıyordun!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ama artık o küçük kıskançlık canavarını unut, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
çünkü sana da bir tane aldım,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Umarım rengini seversin. Diğer renklerin
hepsi tükenmişti! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eğer senin için uygunsa,
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}artık senin!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I just happened to be digging some
holes the other day—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I wanted to
make a pit—{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}and I found something...
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I thought maybe you had lost it,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
since it had your name written on
it{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} in permanent marker!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}En creusant un trou l'autre jour,
pour poser un piè...{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} euh, passons !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Je pense avoir trouvé un truc à toi !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'est-à-dire{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. {{TAG:0003:0024:}}ton nom est écrit
dessus au marqueur indélébile !
{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}(Coriace, le marqueur...){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Stavo scavando un po' di buche
in giro l'altro giorno e ho trovato
una cosa...
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ho pensato che magari era tua...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Cioè, c'è il tuo nome sopra... Deve
essere tua. È troppo ovvio!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Geçen gün çukur yapmak için birkaç yer
kazıyordum—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}evet, kocaman
bir çukur—{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ve bir şey buldum...
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Üstünde kalıcı kalemle adın yazdığı için{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
bunu kaybetmiş olabileceğini düşündüm!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} I know what you're talking
about.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} I actually meant for that
to stay hidden underground!
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}It brings back some old memories{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
that I'd rather keep hidden.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} But
since you already dug it up{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I guess I'll take it home with me!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Thanks for your kind consideration,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} neden bahsettiğini biliyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Aslında onun yerin altında gizli
kalmasını istemiştim!
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Pek hatırlamak istemediğim bazı eski anıları{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
geri getiriyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ama madem çoktan çıkardın{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}eve götürsem bari!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bu ince düşüncen için teşekkür ederim,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Kasabadaki güncel eğilimler hakkında {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ÇOK önemli
bir anket yapıyorum ve {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}fikrini almak istedim!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Sence {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} içindeki en gözde tarzlar neler? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Kıyafetten{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} makyaja, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}hobilerden ne istersen!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You know all the classic dances,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}I thought you could teach me
some of those {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}old-timey moves!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}I want to learn the Charleston{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} and
the Mashed Potato {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}and the Bop!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}
And break dancing, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}if you can do it!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bütün klasik dansları biliyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bana şu {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}eski usul hareketlerden
birkaçını öğretirsin diye düşündüm!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Charleston,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Mashed Potato {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ve Bop
öğrenmek istiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}
Yapabiliyorsan break dans da, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}tabii!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Si está todo resuelto, me marcho
Tengo cosas que hacer.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Gracias por todo, corazoncín.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ya nos veremos.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sanırım artık gideyim,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}başka yardım edebileceğim bir şey yoksa tabii.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Bize yardım ettiği için{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}
özellikle teşekkürler. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} ile güzel vakit geçir.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}} Hoşça kal!
